{"seq":2,"slug":"data-handling","title":"数据处理篇","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/data-handling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"timezone-datetime-handling","title":"时区与日期时间处理","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/data-handling/timezone-datetime-handling","wordCount":1577,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"currency-number-formatting","title":"货币与数字格式化","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/data-handling/currency-number-formatting","wordCount":1556,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"collation-sorting-search","title":"排序规则与搜索","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/data-handling/collation-sorting-search","wordCount":1541,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 数据处理篇\n\n数据处理篇聚焦后端系统中三类最常出错的 locale 敏感数据：时间、金额和文本排序。每一类都有各自的陷阱——时区偏移在 DST 切换时吞掉一小时、货币精度在浮点运算中丢失分位、排序结果在不同 collation 下完全翻转。三篇文档分别给出存储模型、计算策略和格式化输出的工程方案，目标是让数据从写入到展示的全链路保持跨 locale 的正确性。\n"}